---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';

const title = 'User Agent Bulk Checker';
const description =
	'Put a list of URLs and check the user agent response code. Check Googlebot, Bingbot, GPTBot and more, all at once.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={title} description={description} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="prose">
			<span class="eyebrow">§ 02 — SEO Tools</span>
			<h1>User Agent Bulk Checker</h1>
			<hr class="rule" />
			<p>
				The web is packed with new AI bots. GPTBot, ClaudeBot, Bytespider, CCBot, PerplexityBot and
				more.
			</p>
			<p>What response code did each user agent receive from a URL / domain?</p>
			<p>
				The User Agent Bulk Checker allows you to do a quick check on 25+ of AI, search and SEO
				bots, all at once. You can add up to 20 URLs from multiple domains in one go and get an
				instant answer.
			</p>
			<p>
				<em
					>Ps: some companies have strict controls and know when it's not the real user agent
					(e.g. matching the IP addresses). In these cases, all results return a 4XX.</em
				>
			</p>

			<div class="tool-embed">
				<iframe
					src="https://bulk-bot-checker.streamlit.app/?embed=true"
					title="User Agent Bulk Checker"
					loading="lazy"
				></iframe>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.prose {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1rem;
	}
	.rule {
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
	}
	.tool-embed {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}
	.tool-embed iframe {
		width: 100%;
		height: 800px;
		border: 1px solid rgb(var(--line));
	}
</style>
